00:18:21,025 --> 00:18:23,365
But if your spirit wins, you walk away!

274
00:18:23,465 --> 00:18:24,585
It's as simple as that!

275
00:18:24,585 --> 00:18:28,505
All right, then, I wish you a pleasant journey.

276
00:18:28,885 --> 00:18:30,665
To the valley of death, that is!

277
00:18:32,665 --> 00:18:35,465
Emporial Healing Hormone!

278
00:18:35,465 --> 00:18:35,605
No!

279
00:19:05,465 --> 00:19:31,565
Oh, are you pulling my tail?

280
00:19:31,565 --> 00:19:36,565
Strawboy has been wailing in agony like that for ten hours!

281
00:19:36,565 --> 00:19:40,565
Spirit and hormones, these are the vital forces of the human body.

282
00:19:40,565 --> 00:19:44,565
Combined, the two bring forth a tremendous healing potential.

283
00:19:48,565 --> 00:19:54,565
I have drawn out his latent immunity and changed his body to enable him to battle with the deadly poison.

284
00:19:54,565 --> 00:19:57,565
Only time will tell which of the two of them is stronger.

285
00:19:57,565 --> 00:20:03,565
Within that battlefield of a body lies destruction and recovery raging away at extraordinary speeds.

286
00:20:03,565 --> 00:20:07,565
He will survive only if he could withstand all that pain.

287
00:20:07,565 --> 00:20:10,565
And escaping from death does not come cheap.

288
00:20:10,565 --> 00:20:20,565
You can take a look inside if you really want to.

289
00:20:20,565 --> 00:20:26,565
