290
00:20:26,565 --> 00:20:38,565
Strawboy?

291
00:20:38,565 --> 00:20:44,565
How awful! He's gonna die!

292
00:20:44,565 --> 00:20:47,565
It's gonna tear him apart!

293
00:20:47,565 --> 00:20:50,565
His body will be destroyed from the inside out!

294
00:20:50,565 --> 00:20:54,565
That wasn't even him in there! It was a living corpse!

295
00:20:54,565 --> 00:20:58,565
I'm begging you here! Don't let him suffer like that! You have to do something!

296
00:20:58,565 --> 00:21:03,565
Please! Unlock those chains! Stop the bleeding and find a real way to cure him!

297
00:21:03,565 --> 00:21:06,565
Oh, you're the miracle worker, aren't you?

298
00:21:06,565 --> 00:21:10,565
I know he's a mess, but anything is better than this!

299
00:21:10,565 --> 00:21:12,565
Shut the hell up!

300
00:21:12,565 --> 00:21:17,565
I'm helping him the only way I can!

301
00:21:17,565 --> 00:21:20,565
Don't underestimate the human will to live!

302
00:21:20,565 --> 00:21:21,565
The what?

303
00:21:21,565 --> 00:21:25,565
Do you have any idea what it takes to strive against one's own mortality?

304
00:21:25,565 --> 00:21:28,565
To face the ultimate odds?

305
00:21:28,565 --> 00:21:31,565
I'm not a god or an angel or anything like that!

306
00:21:31,565 --> 00:21:33,565
A miracle worker?

307
00:21:33,565 --> 00:21:37,565
You can call me whatever the hell you want, but the truth of the matter is this.

308
00:21:37,565 --> 00:21:41,565
I could never save a fool who doesn't have the will to save himself!

309
00:21:41,565 --> 00:21:46,565
I saved an impoverished country, and a country that was left in ruin after defeat and war!

310
00:21:46,565 --> 00:21:50,565
But in both cases, all I did was draw out their own spirit to live!

311
00:21:50,565 --> 00:21:55,565
That can only happen to people who have the courage to keep on fighting!

312
00:21:55,565 --> 00:21:58,565
Making miracles is never easy!

